{"step_index":30,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-05T21:47:34Z","input_tokens":2285,"cache_read_tokens":43380,"output_tokens":1032,"thinking":"The port scan reveals several open ports on `192.168.10.1`, including common services like FTP, SSH, Telnet, DNS, and HTTP. Also notable are ports for bandwidth testing, the Winbox configuration tool, and another potentially application-specific port. This initial scan provides a broad overview of accessible services.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"# 1. Full HTML of http://192.168.10.1\n$resp = Invoke-WebRequest -Uri \"http://192.168.10.1\" -UseBasicParsing -TimeoutSec 3\nWrite-Host \"=== WEBFIG HTML ===\"\nWrite-Host $resp.Content\n\n# 2. MNDP Discovery bound to 192.168.10.228:5678\nWrite-Host \"=== MNDP DISCOVERY ===\"\ntry {\n    $localEp = New-Object System.Net.IPEndPoint([System.Net.IPAddress]::Parse(\"192.168.10.228\"), 5678)\n    $udp = New-Object System.Net.Sockets.UdpClient($localEp)\n    $udp.EnableBroadcast = $true\n    $udp.Client.ReceiveTimeout = 3000\n    $bytes = [byte[]](0,0,0,0)\n    $udp.Send($bytes, $bytes.Length, \"255.255.255.255\", 5678) | Out-Null\n    $remoteEp = New-Object System.Net.IPEndPoint([System.Net.IPAddress]::Any, 0)\n    $data = $udp.Receive([ref]$remoteEp)\n    Write-Host \"Received MNDP from $($remoteEp.Address) ($($data.Length) bytes)\"\n    $pos = 4\n    while ($pos + 4 -le $data.Length) {\n        $type = [uint16](($data[$pos] -shl 8) -bor $data[$pos+1])\n        $len = [uint16](($data[$pos+2] -shl 8) -bor $data[$pos+3])\n        $pos += 4\n        if ($pos + $len -le $data.Length -and $len -gt 0) {\n            $valBytes = $data[$pos..($pos+$len-1)]\n            $strVal = [System.Text.Encoding]::UTF8.GetString($valBytes)\n            $hexVal = ($valBytes | ForEach-Object { $_.ToString(\"X2\") }) -join \":\"\n            Write-Host (\"  TLV {0,2} (len {1,2}): ASCII='{2}' | HEX={3}\" -f $type, $len, $strVal, $hexVal)\n        }\n        $pos += $len\n    }\n    $udp.Close()\n} catch {\n    Write-Host \"MNDP Error: $_\"\n    if ($udp) { $udp.Close() }\n}","WaitMsBeforeAsync":8000,"toolSummary":"Get WebFig page content and MNDP broadcast info from 192.168.10.1"}}]}
